      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Mn-containing alloy, rapid oxide growth and high defect density cause cracking and spallation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The CrFeCoNiMn baseline has an unstable oxide layer prone to spallation.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidation behavior in CrMnFeCoNi is temperature- and time-dependent, including changes in manganese-oxide products and a transition from linear to parabolic kinetics.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
